-- Paket ABT "abt-a5-merah-5nov" (5 Nov 2026): teks merah A5 dan [98] Cabut (keputusan Derry). Hanya blangko derry_briantono dan isian blangkonya.
-- PRASYARAT "A|B|C": A = nomor paket berisi lain dari paket (0) | B = variabel paket persis (0 pasang pertama / 9 pasang ulang) | C = variabel lama yang dirujuk ada: 9683, 46 (2)
SELECT CONCAT_WS('|',
 (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM abt_variabel v WHERE v.no_var IN (9284,9285,9286,9287,9288,9289,9294,9295,9296) AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM (SELECT 9284 AS n, 'aadc95038b4590e9889380cdf8073113' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9285 AS n, '0b88995acb10f9fc0958baf98c15e419' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9286 AS n, '187a00b62232db9c40a2fd76b44b9e16' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9287 AS n, 'f73f85801a5fd530f99279b9b1cba7e1' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9288 AS n, 'e193cd826ea2edf6eb8321a528d78283' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9289 AS n, 'da121a1e3d98cdb7bf55537f8419cc43' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9294 AS n, '3c2fea45b505c177b5e8bd934e19824d' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9295 AS n, 'fc914d2e0e1d5072da756b821806edfb' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9296 AS n, '355485008d17f94fe97fad13a6778689' AS h) p WHERE p.n = v.no_var AND p.h = MD5(CONCAT_WS('|', v.nama, v.data_type, IFNULL(v.sql_query, ''), IFNULL(v.referensi, ''), IFNULL(v.multi_sidang, ''), IFNULL(v.default_data, ''), v.locked, IFNULL(v.modifier, ''))))),
 (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM abt_variabel v JOIN (SELECT 9284 AS n, 'aadc95038b4590e9889380cdf8073113' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9285 AS n, '0b88995acb10f9fc0958baf98c15e419' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9286 AS n, '187a00b62232db9c40a2fd76b44b9e16' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9287 AS n, 'f73f85801a5fd530f99279b9b1cba7e1' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9288 AS n, 'e193cd826ea2edf6eb8321a528d78283' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9289 AS n, 'da121a1e3d98cdb7bf55537f8419cc43' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9294 AS n, '3c2fea45b505c177b5e8bd934e19824d' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9295 AS n, 'fc914d2e0e1d5072da756b821806edfb' AS h UNION ALL SELECT 9296 AS n, '355485008d17f94fe97fad13a6778689' AS h) p ON p.n = v.no_var AND p.h = MD5(CONCAT_WS('|', v.nama, v.data_type, IFNULL(v.sql_query, ''), IFNULL(v.referensi, ''), IFNULL(v.multi_sidang, ''), IFNULL(v.default_data, ''), v.locked, IFNULL(v.modifier, '')))),
 (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM abt_variabel WHERE no_var IN (9683,46))) AS p;
